-F966qnzSRTBPG_rR-aih9oeldNo8MBQ6442hCSJk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4d-5Pdn5tCY59W1QYNu60o9_pIYshIzT1LEeg24HySjg&oe=69FC928F"}, {"file_name": "Gamestill_2_1.png", "id": "730993767596206", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75292490_730993774262872_7203892228344656958_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I7KwiBkMZuwQ7kNvwEAcVgl&_nc_oc=AdrD4Z-bzEfGo6K9Y0o9nColfbAcrS34E3sSkRXNxf5V2FyhgebkpPX6QkSDkC0s99I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5GVyhEA1Wz_lFPrOP0KS4Fwka_NzDTwWsweSWXzMLUFQ&oe=69FCA03D"}, {"file_name": "Gamestill_2_3.png", "id": "2939976282883307", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036632_2939976286216640_5800461904326178318_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cAW58pJoAn4Q7kNvwHS5d1F&_nc_oc=AdocgJpZOVei7HidZ3cPwq2wlBOkAfvra1slmU_LCD3Xi5RyQaHIkz687IUrdGiZyLs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7uoYHCzzrL1vkWoIbeOAVY_SPQs_T3ke-zLPqE7k2u6Q&oe=69FC9A95"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Painting VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Painting in virtual reality is easy as one two three: mix your colors, dip your brush in and start painting. \n\nThe experience is very hands-on, easy to understand, and aimed at all ages. Play around and feel the relaxing satisfaction of putting unlimited amounts of fresh paint on a huge canvas. Teach yourself the basics of colors, the painting process and composition. Sharpen your skills by experimenting with the tools and techniques at hand, and become part of a new wave of digital artists. All without having to bother about cleaning up afterward. \n", "short_description": "Painting VR is a virtual reality art painting simulation game with gigantic canvases, satisfying brushes, and an unlimited supply of paint. "}]}, "developer_name": "Oisoi.studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://paintingvr.xyz/priv